    "description": "Time to be a Silly Goose! Immerse yourself in the various environments/ever-expanding environments of the Birdverse in Goose Goose Duck. A game of social deduction, where you and your fellow geese must work together to complete your mission. Keep an eye out for those malicious Mallards and foul Fowls, who have infiltrated your team and will do anything to stop you!\r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\n- Built-in Voice Chat with Proximity Chat option!\r\n- 70+ character roles including The Pelican, The Canadian Goose, and The Party Duck!\r\n- 10+ Map locations including The Carnival, S.S. Mothergoose, Mallard Manor, The Basement, Jungle Temple and Ancient Sands!\r\n- 8+ Game Modes including Classic, Draft, Hoot & Seek, Trick or Treat, Goosehunt and Tastes Like Chicken!\r\n- Loads of cosmetics to personalize your goose with Hats, Costumes, Pets, Farts and Player Banners!\r\n- Private and Public Game Lobbies, as well as a Hanging Out mode held in The Lounge.\r\n\r\nConnect with us:\r\nTwitter https://twitter.com/ggd_game \r\nDiscord https://discord.gg/ggd \r\nTiktok https://www.tiktok.com/@ggd_game?lang=en \r\nInstagram https://www.instagram.com/gaggle.fun/?hl=en \r\nFacebook https://www.facebook.com/gaggle.fun/",
